  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Firstly we calculate DU (Degree of unsaturation) of given molecular formula as :-</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DU</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>14</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DU</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;possibility is for alkanes only.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ac165387-8201-4b26-a330-e5e488a76f7e-image.png\" style=\"width: 262px; height: 30px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fc02cd64-a5fd-41de-9961-1e4c30976247-image.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 82px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/54ec0f06-c2b7-439b-9c4b-6a645b087e5f-image.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 74px;\" /></p><p>(PCC stands for parent carbon chain)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Total structural isomers of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>14</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/72a2633a-4b35-465a-84d4-64efb396e413-image.png\" style=\"width: 365px; height: 180px;\" /></p>",
